cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying results, please cite the journal article below."
title: "UAV Autonomous Obstacle Avoidance in Unknown Environments via Deep Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a LiDAR-based 3D autonomous obstacle-avoidance stack
  for a quadrotor: a distributed parallel AirSim simulator, a block-sparse
  probabilistic hash map (BSHM), a curriculum-trained PPO policy with a dual-branch
  feature extractor, and a layered hybrid safety shield (proximity APF, adaptive
  horizon velocity obstacles, RRT*-Safe, distribution-shift guard, distance-based
  speed modulation).
